{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:Observations.TerminalResolutionProof","@type":"LeanModule","name":"Observations.TerminalResolutionProof","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.terminal_resolution_hadronic_mass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.terminal_resolution_hadronic_mass","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/terminal-resolution-proof.lean#L75-L92","doc":"**Proposition (Terminal Resolution of Hadronic Mass).**\nUsing the derived substrate parameter `q = 1.1097`, all four rows\nof the hadronic mass table match NIST CODATA 2022 values:\n1. Proton:  `|m_p^{QOU} − 938.27208943| < 0.001`\n2. Neutron: `|m_n^{QOU} − 939.56542194| < 0.001`\n3. Deuteron: `|m_D^{QOU} − 1875.61294500| < 0.001`\n4. Binding: `|ΔE^{QOU} − 2.22456637| < 0.001`\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{prop:terminal-resolution}` ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prf:terminal-resolution","label":"prf:terminal-resolution","md":"quantum-observable-universe/observations/terminal-resolution-proof.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.row4_binding_CODATA_comparison","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.row4_binding_CODATA_comparison","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/terminal-resolution-proof.lean#L71-L73","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.row3_deuteron_matches_CODATA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.row3_deuteron_matches_CODATA","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/terminal-resolution-proof.lean#L65-L69","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.row2_neutron_matches_CODATA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.row2_neutron_matches_CODATA","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/terminal-resolution-proof.lean#L61-L63","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.row1_proton_matches_CODATA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.row1_proton_matches_CODATA","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/terminal-resolution-proof.lean#L57-L59","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.deuteron_topological","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.deuteron_topological","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/terminal-resolution-proof.lean#L52-L55","doc":"Row 3 — deuteron topological mass as the mass-deficit identity\n`m_p + m_n − binding_energy_QOU` (canonical mirror). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.neutron_topological","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.neutron_topological","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/terminal-resolution-proof.lean#L49-L50","doc":"Row 2 — neutron topological mass = CODATA value (canonical mirror). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.proton_topological","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.proton_topological","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/terminal-resolution-proof.lean#L46-L47","doc":"Row 1 — proton topological mass = CODATA value (canonical mirror). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.binding_energy_QOU","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.binding_energy_QOU","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/terminal-resolution-proof.lean#L41-L44","doc":"Deuteron binding-energy anchor (MeV), the experimental deficit\n`(m_p + m_n) − m_D` rounded to 4 sig figs — NOT an independent\ncategorical prediction (see canonical-source honesty note). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.binding_energy_CODATA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.binding_energy_CODATA","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/terminal-resolution-proof.lean#L38-L39","doc":"Deuteron binding energy in MeV (NIST CODATA 2022 derived: 2.22456637(76)). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.deuteron_mass_MeV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.deuteron_mass_MeV","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/terminal-resolution-proof.lean#L35-L36","doc":"Deuteron mass energy equivalent in MeV/c² (NIST CODATA 2022: 1875.612 945 00(58)). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.neutron_mass_MeV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HadronicMass.neutron_mass_MeV","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/terminal-resolution-proof.lean#L32-L33","doc":"Neutron mass energy equivalent in MeV/c² (NIST CODATA 2022: 939.565 421 94(48)). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HadronicMass.proton_mass_MeV","@type":"LeanDec